1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,500
The tsunami approaches the coast.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,450
In shallow water, it slows and rises.

3
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:12,130
The surge crosses the shoreline
and rushes through streets.

4
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,640
Floodwater spreads inland
and gradually slows.

